MACRO P                                                                         
 &P.WORK-WORKAREA                                   W        33 A               
*                                 PARAMETERS TO WORKDAY FOR                     
*                                 COMPUTATION OF WORKING DAYS.                  
*                                 EXAMPLE OF CALL:                              
*                                 COMPUTE NO. OF WORKING DAYS                   
*                                 BETWEEN TIAAMMDD-FOM AND -TOM                 
*                                 MOVE 001  TO WORK-KDCALL                      
*                                 MOVE 21   TO WORK-IDDC                        
*                                 MOVE DAY1 TO WORK-TIAAMMDD-FOM                
*                                 MOVE DAY2 TO WORK-TIAAMMDD-TOM                
*                                 CALL WORKDAY USING                            
*                                      WORK-KDCALL                              
*                                      WORK-DATE-AREA                           
*                                      WORK-KDSVAR                              
*                                 RESULT IS PLACED IN                           
*                                 WORK-DATE-AREA                                
*                                 RETURN CODE IN WORK-KDSVAR                    
*                                 -------------------------------               
     &P.WORK-KDCALL &P.WORK-WORKAREA                          3 N               
*                                 TYPE OF COMPUTATION IN WORKDAY                
*                                 KDCALL:                                       
*                                  1=  COMPUTE WORKD  =                         
*                                                TOM MINUS FOM                  
*                                      (1 DAY IF FOM = TOM)                     
*                                  2=  COMPUTE TOM =                            
*                                                FOM PLUS WORKD                 
*                                     (1 WORKDAY MAKES TOM = FOM)               
*                                  3=  COMPUTE FOM =                            
*                                                TOM MINUS WORKD                
*                                     (1 WORKDAY MAKES TOM = FOM)               
*                                  THE FIELDS NEEDED FOR THE                    
*                                  COMPUTATION MUST BE ASSIGNED                 
*                                  BEFORE THE CALL.                             
     &P.WORK-DATE-AREA &P.WORK-WORKAREA                 +3   29 A               
      &P.WORK-IDDC &P.WORK-WORKAREA                     +3    2 A               
*                                 IDENTIFIERARE LAGER                           
*                                 WAREHOUSE IDENTIFIER                          
      &P.WORK-TIAAMMDD-FOM &P.WORK-WORKAREA             +5    6 N               
*                                 ≈R - M≈NAD - DAG  (≈≈MMDD)                    
*                                 YEAR - MONTH - DAY  (YYMMDD)                  
      &P.WORK-TIAAMMDD-TOM &P.WORK-WORKAREA            +11    6 N               
*                                 ≈R - M≈NAD - DAG  (≈≈MMDD)                    
*                                 YEAR - MONTH - DAY  (YYMMDD)                  
      &P.WORK-KVWORKD &P.WORK-WORKAREA                 +17    3 N               
*                                 ANTAL ARBETSDAGAR                             
*                                 NUMBER OF WORKING DAYS                        
      &P.WORK-TIAAMMDD-NEXT-WORKDAY &P.WORK-WORKAREA                   +        
                                                       +20    6 N               
*                                 ≈R - M≈NAD - DAG  (≈≈MMDD)                    
*                                 YEAR - MONTH - DAY  (YYMMDD)                  
      &P.WORK-TIAAMMDD-NEXT-WEEK &P.WORK-WORKAREA                      +        
                                                       +26    6 N               
*                                 ≈R - M≈NAD - DAG  (≈≈MMDD)                    
*                                 YEAR - MONTH - DAY  (YYMMDD)                  
     &P.WORK-KDSVAR &P.WORK-WORKAREA                   +32    1 A               
*                                                       KDSVAR-88               
*                                 SVARSKOD FR≈N SUBPROGRAM                      
*                                                       KDSVAR-88               
*                                 RETURN CODE FROM SUBPROGRAM                   
*** END COPY                             LENGTH =            33                 
